{"id":1208,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p><br></p><p>2026年4月30日，星海音乐学院声乐歌剧系党总支书记吴惠敏、党总支副书记乔永平、教师陈仕尧一行到访艺术学院，围绕学科建设、科研创新及高层次教学成果培育等议题举行专题学术交流研讨会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nmlaPUz-YLmM7UPzVRL8U4LNrkLmVYkMRlsL7rRM4-PUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2oSyYU1yaMmCbUz67LR7PUm9PLln2nzr7M7Canz9bM7VFnzv8n77solMFnRNanSbaptveo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGaLYyYLRC4MSbw6248c&oid=2004969448&tid=2003&nid=20635&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FF92B0669A7D011B811DFE5D4F0E894A/E74DA79C/D90E\" vheight=\"219\" vwidth=\"292\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nmlaPUz-YLmM7UPzVRL8U4LNrkLmVYkMRlsL7rRM4-PUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2oSyYU1yaMmCbUz67LR7PUm9PLln2nzr7M7Canz9bM7VFnzv8n77solMFnRNanSbaptveo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGaLYyYLRC4MSbw6248c&oid=2004969448&tid=2003&nid=20635&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>双方以国家教学成果奖申报与全流程管理、非物质文化遗产传承人研培项目的体系构建与效能评估等议题，围绕“以创作引领科研、以展演反哺教学”的实践路径、跨校协同申报的可行性机制，以及教学科研并重的组织保障与师资梯队建设等关键环节，分享了各自的经验与思考。同时，双方就跨校创演合作、科研团队互访及课程资源共享等达成了广泛共识，致力于构建长效协作机制，实现优势互补与协同奋进。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0Uz7aZL8WRUNQfUPNlinRfVo7QRUmvYPUzlDnmLPU494LmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRLYyZLYh7oRNbLzCYMNWVUlLZU49ZMRGDn7VfLR7ZU8MFL7lbU8LDM8rFnNL4MSbaptveo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGaLYyYLRC4MSbw6248c&oid=2004969448&tid=2003&nid=20635&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1C383D8991626BEAC8C88406DAA018CC/0E9CC67E/FC35\" vheight=\"219\" vwidth=\"292\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0Uz7aZL8WRUNQfUPNlinRfVo7QRUmvYPUzlDnmLPU494LmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRLYyZLYh7oRNbLzCYMNWVUlLZU49ZMRGDn7VfLR7ZU8MFL7lbU8LDM8rFnNL4MSbaptveo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGaLYyYLRC4MSbw6248c&oid=2004969448&tid=2003&nid=20635&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>新时代高等艺术教育内涵式发展的背景下，跨区域、跨学科的资源共享与协同创新已成为提升艺术科研与教学成果质量的重要路径。未来，两校将深化合作交流，夯实“优势互补、平台共筑、成果共创”的长效协作机制，共同为推动艺术学科的高质量发展与新时代美育建设贡献力量。</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nmlaPUz-YLmM7UPzVRL8U4LNrkLmVYkMRlsL7rRM4-PUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2oSyYU1yaMmCbUz67LR7PUm9PLln2nzr7M7Canz9bM7VFnzv8n77solMFnRNanSbaptveo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGaLYyYLRC4MSbw6248c&oid=2004969448&tid=2003&nid=20635&e=.png"}